{"id":"vod_lz_65339","vodId":"65339","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"游戏人生","name_cn":"游戏人生","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230629-1/b5e9add91b10916d2a28c32703fbb063.jpg"},"summary":"　　空（松冈祯丞 配音）和白（茅野爱衣）是网络世界里人尽皆知的传奇人物，两人在虚拟的战斗中所向披靡，甚至被称为传说一般的存在。然而，在现实世界中，兄妹两人却是连家门都不敢出的“御宅族”，患有严重的人群恐惧症。　　某日，空和白收到了一位陌生少年传来的讯息，因而被召唤到了异世界中 ，在这里，人类种、森精种、天翼种和机凯种生活在同一片土地之上，这里没有战争和暴力，有的只是一场又一场无休无止的游戏，一切利益和权利，皆由游戏的结果决定。弱势的人类种在游戏中节节败退最终蜗居在最后一片净土之上，空和白的到来能否改变这悲惨的现状？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-29 11:53:25","classic":true,"classicRank":30,"franchise":"游戏人生","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29687_9e0ac753/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29686_f50e4d25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29688_0005c3c6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29690_70eb0c7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29689_a24cc8fc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29691_7fc7f5df/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29692_9e5292cc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29694_5f61cac0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29693_8c15a461/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29695_3800cc4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29696_db015389/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230628/29697_a56872cb/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:05.339Z"}